{"a":[23,24],"h":"<p>23.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 177.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 31.4 31.4 39.0 39.0 54.7 54.7 54.7 61.4 61.4 68.2 76.4 76.4 93.0 93.0 103.4 103.4 119.2 119.2 128.2 128.2 141.0 141.0 147.7 154.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 141.0 147.7 154.4 161.2\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Hiç ben ondan başka ilâhlarmı edinirim, başka ma'budlar mı tutarım? Çünkü<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"191\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 191.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 24.0 24.0 38.2 38.2 54.0 54.0 64.4 64.4 73.4 73.4 85.4 85.4 93.0 100.4 116.2 116.2 126.7 126.7 134.2 134.2 141.7 141.7 157.4 157.4 168.0 168.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"85.4 174.7\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> eğer o Rahman - rahmetiyle beni yaratmış olan Rahman - ya beni bir durrile bir sıkıntı ile sıkmak isterse <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 221.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 36.7 57.0 57.0 66.0 66.0 74.2 74.2 81.0 90.0 96.7 103.4 123.7 135.0 135.0 135.0 141.7 159.7 159.7 170.2 170.2 177.0 177.0 192.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 81.0 96.7 103.4 141.7 197.2 204.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onların, ya'ni ondan başka tapılanların benden yana şefaatleri hiç bir faide vermez<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 110.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.8 57.8 73.6 85.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"78.0 85.6 93.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve beni kurtaramazlar - hiç biri ma'bud olamazlar 24.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"207\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 206.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 56.3 56.3 66.7 78.7 101.3 112.6 112.6 119.3 135.7 142.6 142.6 150.0 150.0 156.7 165.7 165.7 177.0 177.0 177.0 183.7 183.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"72.0 78.7 119.3 190.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şübhesiz ki o takdirde - beni yaradan Rahmandan başka ma'budlar edindiğim surette - ap açık bir dalâl içindeyimdir. 25. </p>"}